<% content_for :title, "Home" %>

<section class="border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-12 items-start">
    <div class="md:col-span-3">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-slate-500 mb-4">
        Decision-support prototype
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-tight">
        Find the Ministry of Education standard designs relevant to your school
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
        Instead of reading through multiple Ministry PDFs, answer a short set of questions
        about your school and get a transparent, explainable shortlist of the standard
        building types and layouts that may be relevant — with every reason traced back to
        a documented source.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <%= link_to "Start", questionnaire_start_path,
              class: "inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-slate-900 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-slate-700" %>
        <%= link_to "Browse all standard building types", building_types_path,
              class: "text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 hover:text-slate-900 underline underline-offset-4" %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-2 border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-900">What this tool does</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
        <li>— Turns the Ministry's standard-design PDFs into a structured, searchable format</li>
        <li>— Asks about your school type, roll, spaces, and facilities</li>
        <li>— Shows which standard building types (Type S, D, H, G, K) may be relevant, and why</li>
        <li>— Links every claim back to its Ministry source document and page, where available</li>
        <li>— Clearly labels anything not yet confirmed against a Ministry PDF</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
  <div class="border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 p-6 max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-900">Disclaimer</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-amber-900 leading-relaxed">
      This tool is intended to assist with early consideration of Ministry of Education
      standard design options. It does not replace Ministry of Education requirements,
      project-specific advice, professional architectural design, engineering advice,
      consent requirements or approval processes. It does not grant, imply, or represent
      Ministry of Education approval of any kind. Always confirm current Ministry
      requirements and applicable project documentation directly with the Ministry before
      proceeding.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      Built for use by school principals, property managers, boards of trustees,
      architects, and Ministry property teams during early consideration of a property
      project — not as a replacement for any of those roles.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
